  {
   "id": "knowledge_intro",
   "kind": "interstitial",
   "group": "Knowledge",
   "illustration": "toolkit",
   "title": "A quick knowledge check, not a test",
   "body": [
    "A few short questions help CSS decide which explanations to show you.",
    "There is no pass mark. 'I'm not sure yet' is always an option and simply points you to the right lesson."
   ]
